{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123592","id":4563573847,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEAKcVw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123592","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123592.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123592.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123592","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123592/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123592/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123592/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ac963137a2cd7e37129c2db3dbb0a114a47c2335","number":123592,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add property to test mouse and touch input","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15255\r\n\r\nAdds `emulate_swap_mouse_and_touch` to Input.\r\nThis makes mouse events be treated as touch events and vice versa.\r\nMore controls are getting dedicated touch handling, this is useful for testing the touch behavior from a device with only a mouse, and mouse behavior from touch screen devices.\r\nThere are some limitations with this, like unpressed mouse motion can't be emulated and it doesn't handle emulating long presses.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI can add a project setting if wanted.\r\nI went with a single setting since having two means one of them would not be useful depending on your device.\r\nIt works together with the regular emulate settings to be more accurate to how input would work when that input type is actually used.\r\nAlso added more details to the docs of the regular emulate settings.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers